    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Galaxy Warring State Chronicle Rai",
        "jpn": "銀河戦国群雄伝ライ"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Rai is a space opera that fuses feudal Chinese and Japanese customs with vast galaxy spanning empires and space-going societies. Follows the life and times of the samurai Rai, and the quest of several spacefaring factions for control of territory and, of course, the Empire.",
        "jpn": "ライは、封建的な中国と日本の習慣を、帝国や宇宙に行く社会にまたがる広大な銀河と融合させたスペースオペラです。 侍ライの生涯と時代、そして領土と、もちろん帝国を支配するためのいくつかの宇宙飛行派閥の探求をたどります。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Thunder Jet - Raiders of the Galaxy Empire",
        "Rai: Galactic Civil War Chronicle",
        "銀河戦国群雄伝ライ"
    ],
